      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Prompt -> layered SVG\n\n1. Vector Art Prompt (green): type just the SUBJECT (\"a fox mascot head\", \"a treasure chest icon\").\n   style = flat vector illustration, cartoon character, logo / emblem, icon, sticker, line art, game item / UI art,\n   stylized game character. colors / palette (hex or PICO-8, DB32...) are asked for in the prompt AND used by\n   Layered Vectorize. detail: fewer details = fewer, bigger shapes. outlines become the ink layer; shading\n   'one shadow + one highlight' fills the shadow/highlight layers, 'flat' gives the fewest shapes.\n   See the full prompt in \"Final prompt\". Change the seed in the sampler for variations.\n2. Z-Image Turbo (Apache-2.0) draws it at 1024x1024 in ~10 s; the drawing is saved too\n   (output/svg/prompt_to_svg_image_*.png).\n3. AI upscale x4 -> 2048 px -> Layered Vectorize (same settings as layered-svg) -> output/svg/prompt_to_svg_*.svg.\n\"Shapes & file size\" shows how simple the SVG came out."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME"
    },
